	(text "DISPLAY: 7in 1024x600 EK79007 bare COG panel, 2-lane MIPI-DSI from the module; same FPC pin-out and panel\nsupplies as the Waveshare reference board (all from 5V_LCD, switched by EXP_EN_LCD, PM2 CH1):\nAVDD 9.6 V (AP3012 boost), VGH +18 V / VGL -7.5 V (charge pumps off the AVDD switch node, zener clamps),\nVCOM = AVDD/3, VCC_1V8 (AP2112K-1.8 instead of RT9193-18), backlight AP3032 (1.3R sense ~150 mA).\nBacklight dimming: LCD_BL_PWM (GPIO32) -> 10k/100nF -> 68k into FB: higher duty = dimmer (as reference).\nDSI pairs 100R differential, length-matched. Touch: GT911 on the shared I2C, RST GPIO23, INT GPIO26."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 266.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
